<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Serpents"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Neck Deep"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Life's Not Out To Get You"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="33933853"/><amll:meta key="qqMusicId" value="102948306"/><amll:meta key="spotifyId" value="4SqIMK3ILlAsC4FkVgC4Lf"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1716631803"/><amll:meta key="isrc" value="USHR21579007"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="157899616"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Fifty-Four54"/></metadata></head><body dur="02:28.900"><div begin="00:03.500" end="02:28.900"><p begin="00:03.500" end="00:05.750" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L0"><span begin="00:03.500" end="00:04.430">Don't get too</span> <span begin="00:04.450" end="00:05.750">close</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">别靠得太近</span></p><p begin="00:06.100" end="00:08.370" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1"><span begin="00:06.100" end="00:07.100">That place is</span> <span begin="00:07.110" end="00:08.370">haunted</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">那个地方闹鬼</span></p><p begin="00:08.630" end="00:10.710" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2"><span begin="00:08.630" end="00:09.600">Fear not the</span> <span begin="00:09.770" end="00:10.710">ghosts</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">别害怕那些幽灵</span></p><p begin="00:11.000" end="00:15.300" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3"><span begin="00:11.000" end="00:12.170">Cause she sent them</span> <span begin="00:12.210" end="00:15.300">running</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">因为是她把它们驱赶而来的</span></p><p begin="00:16.200" end="00:20.650" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4"><span begin="00:16.200" end="00:17.900">She sleeps beneath the</span> <span begin="00:18.000" end="00:20.650">surface</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">她沉睡于地面之下</span></p><p begin="00:21.500" end="00:26.200" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5"><span begin="00:21.500" end="00:23.100">Consorting with the</span> <span begin="00:23.150" end="00:26.200">serpents</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">与群蛇为伍</span></p><p begin="00:26.730" end="00:33.140" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6"><span begin="00:26.730" end="00:28.400">She strikes without a</span> <span begin="00:28.490" end="00:33.140">purpose</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">她毫无理由地发起侵袭</span></p><p begin="00:35.100" end="00:37.200" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7"><span begin="00:35.100" end="00:36.050">A dark face</span> <span begin="00:36.100" end="00:36.230">in a</span> <span begin="00:36.300" end="00:37.200">corridor</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">走廊深处那张阴暗的脸</span></p><p begin="00:37.800" end="00:39.650" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8"><span begin="00:37.800" end="00:38.830">Deceptively</span> <span begin="00:38.930" end="00:39.650">beautiful</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">美得近乎虚假</span></p><p begin="00:39.670" end="00:41.240" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9"><span begin="00:39.670" end="00:41.240">She's watching you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">她注视着你</span></p><p begin="00:41.550" end="00:43.930" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10"><span begin="00:41.550" end="00:41.970">She's in</span> <span begin="00:42.000" end="00:42.900">everything</span> <span begin="00:42.950" end="00:43.930">you do</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">潜伏在你做的每件事里</span></p><p begin="00:45.700" end="00:47.630" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11"><span begin="00:45.700" end="00:46.300">Her kiss</span> <span begin="00:46.300" end="00:46.860">it tastes</span> <span begin="00:46.860" end="00:47.630">so sweet</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">她的吻甜得令人沉醉</span></p><p begin="00:47.630" end="00:50.060" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12"><span begin="00:47.630" end="00:48.490">But left me</span> <span begin="00:48.490" end="00:49.150">with a</span> <span begin="00:49.200" end="00:50.060">lethargy</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">却让我陷入无法挣脱的倦怠</span></p><p begin="00:50.060" end="00:51.800" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13"><span begin="00:50.060" end="00:50.450">I</span> <span begin="00:50.500" end="00:51.000">couldn't</span> <span begin="00:51.000" end="00:51.800">shake</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我怎么也摆脱不了</span></p><p begin="00:52.000" end="00:55.100" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14"><span begin="00:52.000" end="00:52.400">I</span> <span begin="00:52.500" end="00:52.920">made a</span> <span begin="00:52.900" end="00:53.200">great</span> <span begin="00:53.200" end="00:55.100">mistake</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我犯下了一个致命的错误</span></p><p begin="00:55.850" end="00:57.180" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15"><span begin="00:55.850" end="00:56.350">I gave her</span> <span begin="00:56.350" end="00:57.180">my heart</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我把心交给了她</span></p><p begin="00:57.180" end="00:58.260" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16"><span begin="00:57.180" end="00:57.650">She didn't</span> <span begin="00:57.690" end="00:58.260">want it</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">可她根本不想要它</span></p><p begin="00:58.260" end="01:00.900" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17"><span begin="00:58.260" end="00:59.270">Took it anyway</span> <span begin="00:59.350" end="01:00.000">and put a dark spell</span> <span begin="01:00.000" end="01:00.900">on it</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">她还是强行夺走并在上面施下黑暗的咒语</span></p><p begin="01:00.900" end="01:05.000" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18"><span begin="01:00.900" end="01:01.850">Since then</span> <span begin="01:01.850" end="01:03.030">I haven't been</span> <span begin="01:02.900" end="01:05.000">the same</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">从那以后我再也不是原来的自己</span></p><p begin="01:05.980" end="01:08.650" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19"><span begin="01:05.980" end="01:06.750">Needed a</span> <span begin="01:06.750" end="01:07.570">victim</span> <span begin="01:07.650" end="01:08.000">and she</span> <span begin="01:08.060" end="01:08.650">got it</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">她需要一个猎物而她得手了</span></p><p begin="01:08.650" end="01:10.050" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20"><span begin="01:08.650" end="01:10.050">Took me in with her song</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">她用歌声将我引入深渊</span></p><p begin="01:10.080" end="01:11.440" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21"><span begin="01:10.080" end="01:10.560">Powerless to</span> <span begin="01:10.560" end="01:11.440">stop it</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我毫无抵抗之力</span></p><p begin="01:11.650" end="01:15.800" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22"><span begin="01:11.650" end="01:12.270">Some men</span> <span begin="01:12.300" end="01:13.400">don't dare to speak</span> <span begin="01:13.400" end="01:15.800">her name</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">有些男人甚至不敢提起她的名字</span></p><p begin="01:27.000" end="01:29.900" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23"><span begin="01:27.000" end="01:28.340">She picked me up </span> <span begin="01:28.380" end="01:29.120">from my</span> <span begin="01:29.200" end="01:29.900">decline</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">她在我最堕落的时候将我捡起</span></p><p begin="01:30.000" end="01:32.650" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24"><span begin="01:30.000" end="01:30.970">Healed my wounds</span> <span begin="01:30.980" end="01:31.890">with love and</span> <span begin="01:31.890" end="01:32.650">wine</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">用爱与美酒治愈我的伤口</span></p><p begin="01:32.650" end="01:37.300" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25"><span begin="01:32.650" end="01:33.550">Dosed me up</span> <span begin="01:33.550" end="01:34.850">and closed my eyes</span> <span begin="01:34.850" end="01:35.750">a taste of</span> <span begin="01:35.880" end="01:37.300">poison</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">她让我沉醉再轻轻闭上我的双眼，那是一口毒药</span></p><p begin="01:37.450" end="01:40.300" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26"><span begin="01:37.450" end="01:38.900">She gave me all</span> <span begin="01:38.900" end="01:39.500">that I</span> <span begin="01:39.500" end="01:40.300">desired</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">她给了我所有渴望的一切</span></p><p begin="01:40.400" end="01:43.050" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27"><span begin="01:40.400" end="01:41.600">Sung the songs of</span> <span begin="01:41.600" end="01:43.050">angel choirs</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">吟唱着如天使圣歌般的旋律</span></p><p begin="01:43.100" end="01:47.600" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28"><span begin="01:43.100" end="01:46.000">Preached the words of death and fire and left me</span> <span begin="01:46.150" end="01:47.600">burning</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">却宣讲着死亡与烈火的预言，最后只留下我独自在火中燃烧</span></p><p begin="01:47.800" end="01:49.000" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29"><span begin="01:47.800" end="01:48.590">I gave her my</span> <span begin="01:48.590" end="01:49.000">heart</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我把心交给了她</span></p><p begin="01:49.000" end="01:50.150" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30"><span begin="01:49.000" end="01:49.240">She</span> <span begin="01:49.240" end="01:49.500">didn't</span> <span begin="01:49.550" end="01:50.150">want it</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">可她根本不想要它</span></p><p begin="01:50.150" end="01:53.000" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31"><span begin="01:50.150" end="01:51.050">Took it anyway</span> <span begin="01:51.050" end="01:52.170">and put a dark spell</span> <span begin="01:52.170" end="01:53.000">on it</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">她还是夺走了它并施下黑暗的咒语</span></p><p begin="01:53.050" end="01:56.880" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32"><span begin="01:53.050" end="01:53.760">Since then</span> <span begin="01:53.760" end="01:54.900">I haven't been</span> <span begin="01:54.900" end="01:56.880">the same</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">从那以后我再也不是从前的我</span></p><p begin="01:58.000" end="02:00.500" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33"><span begin="01:58.000" end="01:59.450">Needed a victim</span> <span begin="01:59.450" end="01:59.950">and she</span> <span begin="01:59.950" end="02:00.500">got it</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">她需要一个受害者，而她找到了我</span></p><p begin="02:00.570" end="02:01.900" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34"><span begin="02:00.570" end="02:01.900">Took me in with her song</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">她用歌声诱惑我沉沦</span></p><p begin="02:01.900" end="02:03.300" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35"><span begin="02:01.900" end="02:02.500">Powerless to</span> <span begin="02:02.500" end="02:03.300">stop it</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我根本无力反抗</span></p><p begin="02:03.500" end="02:07.600" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36"><span begin="02:03.500" end="02:04.100">Some men</span> <span begin="02:04.150" end="02:05.330">don't dare to speak</span> <span begin="02:05.330" end="02:07.600">her name</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">有些男人甚至不敢说出她的名字</span></p><p begin="02:11.600" end="02:16.600" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37"><span begin="02:11.600" end="02:13.500">She sleeps beneath the</span> <span begin="02:13.600" end="02:16.600">surface</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">她沉睡于深渊之下</span></p><p begin="02:17.000" end="02:21.800" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38"><span begin="02:17.000" end="02:18.650">Consorting with the </span> <span begin="02:18.700" end="02:21.800">serpents</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">与蛇群低语相伴</span></p><p begin="02:22.000" end="02:28.900" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39"><span begin="02:22.000" end="02:23.920">She strikes without a </span> <span begin="02:23.980" end="02:28.900">purpose</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">她毫无理由地发起侵袭</span></p></div></body></tt>